# 关联事件

1. 点击显示视图中的"外观"，向下滑动鼠标到动画列表，点击![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.hicloud.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20210701150018.13068402673121130956071446635556:50520704031946:2800:834D4341E3F369C4792795C7AF365302C9E1CA8ADDCEE9529C9E2799EC12DD38.png?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true)增加动画播放事件。添加刚刚制作的动画。

   ![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.hicloud.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20210701150018.35108699867681966067801282606962:50520704031946:2800:4AF46F202DA1C32919FC11E52FD6791BC08B2253782D1DF96D23CC4AED7E8B03.png?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true "点击放大")
2. 在场景树选中序列帧图片，点击2D事件旁边的![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.hicloud.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20210701150018.35029529760025113445667745621309:50520704031946:2800:A8433B3726B376DE023B4094A80C012E0E724A7D9193BDE98ED36C33E72FBB7F.png?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true)，添加事件。

   ![](https://communityfile-drcn.op.hicloud.com/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20210701150018.90012710306571029922482236032259:50520704031946:2800:46FA887B4268EFB634CC21AA85F0A316A5033FC3593CAFB79E4B25E1E7669AEF.png?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true "点击放大")
